7. CI/CD Pipeline for Node.js Application

Execution Steps
1.Push Node.js code to GitHub
2.Create CodeBuild project
3.Create CodePipeline pipeline
4.Connect GitHub repository
5.Configure deployment stage
6.Push code changes and test auto deployment

Project Overview
Built a CI/CD pipeline to automatically deploy a Node.js application.

AWS Services Used
AWS CodePipeline
AWS CodeBuild
Amazon EC2 / S3

Features
Automated deployment
Continuous integration
Faster release cycle

Architecture
GitHub → CodePipeline → CodeBuild → Deployment
